  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e95750f108e433543aef0099027763ad, type: 3}
  m_Name: Plzen - dragon
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  entryLines:
  - text: Co to, to snad ne, ty jsi drak, v prazdroji?
    speakerName: Branice
  - text: "Hahaha, sko\u010Dila si mi rovnou do hrsti Branice, jak si mohla b\xFDt
      tak naivn\xED."
    speakerName: Drak Prazdroj
  - text: "Ty by si pro Kry\u0161tofa ud\u011Blala opravdu cokoliv."
    speakerName: Drak Prazdroj
  - text: "Co to m\xE1 znamenat?"
    speakerName: Branice
  - text: "To j\xE1 jsem Kry\u0161tofa donutil, aby zni\u010Dil ostatn\xED pivovary,
      po\u0159\xE1d jsem mu namlouval, \u017Ee ho ostatn\xED pomlouvaj\xED, dokud
      mu zcela nep\u0159esko\u010Dilo."
    speakerName: Drak Prazdroj
  - text: "A ty si mu v tom je\u0161t\u011B pom\xE1hala, muHaHahAHAa"
    speakerName: Drak Prazdroj
  - text: "Tak za tohle dostane\u0161 po\u0159\xE1dnou nakl\xE1da\u010Dku, zahr\xE1vat
      si takhle s Kry\u0161tofem...  Rozum\xED\u0161?!?!"
    speakerName: Branice
  - text: HahaHAHhaHAHahHAHHAHAA
    speakerName: Drak Prazdroj
  choices: []
  participantName: Drak
